    "Doddy couldn't show himself in the Dynamic Island, so he can't listen without opening. Open Doddy to talk.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doddy nie mógł pojawić się w Dynamic Island, więc nie może słuchać bez otwierania aplikacji. Otwórz Doddy’ego, żeby porozmawiać."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy counts how often you undo something, change a step, say \"That's wrong\", ask for the same thing again or leave a card unanswered, so you can see whether he gets better. Only the kind of event and the tool name are kept, for 90 days, on this iPhone, never sent.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy zählt, wie oft du etwas rückgängig machst, einen Schritt änderst, „Das stimmt nicht“ sagst, dasselbe noch einmal verlangst oder eine Karte unbeantwortet lässt, damit du sehen kannst, ob er besser wird. Nur die Art des Ereignisses und der Name des Werkzeugs werden behalten, 90 Tage lang, auf diesem iPad, nie gesendet."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy zählt, wie oft du etwas rückgängig machst, einen Schritt änderst, „Das stimmt nicht“ sagst, dasselbe noch einmal verlangst oder eine Karte unbeantwortet lässt, damit du sehen kannst, ob er besser wird. Nur die Art des Ereignisses und der Name des Werkzeugs werden behalten, 90 Tage lang, auf diesem iPhone, nie gesendet."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy counts how often you undo something, change a step, say \"That's wrong\", ask for the same thing again or leave a card unanswered, so you can see whether he gets better. Only the kind of event and the tool name are kept, for 90 days, on this iPad, never sent."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy counts how often you undo something, change a step, say \"That's wrong\", ask for the same thing again or leave a card unanswered, so you can see whether he gets better. Only the kind of event and the tool name are kept, for 90 days, on this iPhone, never sent."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy cuenta cuántas veces deshaces algo, cambias un paso, dices “Eso está mal”, pides lo mismo otra vez o dejas una tarjeta sin responder, para que veas si mejora. Solo se guardan el tipo de evento y el nombre de la herramienta, durante 90 días, en este iPad, y nunca se envían."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy cuenta cuántas veces deshaces algo, cambias un paso, dices “Eso está mal”, pides lo mismo otra vez o dejas una tarjeta sin responder, para que veas si mejora. Solo se guardan el tipo de evento y el nombre de la herramienta, durante 90 días, en este iPhone, y nunca se envían."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy compte combien de fois tu annules quelque chose, modifies une étape, dis « C’est faux », redemandes la même chose ou laisses une carte sans réponse, pour que tu puisses voir s’il progresse. Seuls le type d’événement et le nom de l’outil sont conservés, pendant 90 jours, sur cet iPad, jamais envoyés."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy compte combien de fois tu annules quelque chose, modifies une étape, dis « C’est faux », redemandes la même chose ou laisses une carte sans réponse, pour que tu puisses voir s’il progresse. Seuls le type d’événement et le nom de l’outil sont conservés, pendant 90 jours, sur cet iPhone, jamais envoyés."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "hr": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy broji koliko često nešto poništiš, promijeniš korak, kažeš „To je krivo“, ponovno tražiš isto ili ostaviš karticu bez odgovora, da možeš vidjeti postaje li bolji. Čuvaju se samo vrsta događaja i naziv alata, 90 dana, na ovom iPadu, i nikad se ne šalju."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy broji koliko često nešto poništiš, promijeniš korak, kažeš „To je krivo“, ponovno tražiš isto ili ostaviš karticu bez odgovora, da možeš vidjeti postaje li bolji. Čuvaju se samo vrsta događaja i naziv alata, 90 dana, na ovom iPhoneu, i nikad se ne šalju."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy conta quante volte annulli qualcosa, cambi un passaggio, dici “Non è così”, chiedi di nuovo la stessa cosa o lasci una scheda senza risposta, così puoi vedere se migliora. Vengono conservati solo il tipo di evento e il nome dello strumento, per 90 giorni, su questo iPad, mai inviati."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Doddy conta quante volte annulli qualcosa, cambi un passaggio, dici “Non è così”, chiedi di nuovo la stessa cosa o lasci una scheda senza risposta, così puoi vedere se migliora. Vengono conservati solo il tipo di evento e il nome dello strumento, per 90 giorni, su questo iPhone, mai inviati."
                }
