            "value": "Doddy 会翻看你告诉过他的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doddy makes a PowerPoint file on this iPhone, which Keynote opens. Then you pick Keynote, Files or someone to send it to. Doddy never sends it.": {
