    "From Google Keep: in Google Takeout, export Keep. In the Files app, tap the .zip to unpack it, open the Keep folder and pick the .json files. You can also pick .txt and .md files.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus Google Keep: Exportiere Keep in Google Takeout. Tippe in der App Dateien auf die .zip, um sie zu entpacken, öffne den Ordner Keep und wähle die .json-Dateien. Du kannst auch .txt- und .md-Dateien wählen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desde Google Keep: en Google Takeout, exporta Keep. En la app Archivos, toca el .zip para descomprimirlo, abre la carpeta Keep y elige los archivos .json. También puedes elegir archivos .txt y .md."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Depuis Google Keep : dans Google Takeout, exporte Keep. Dans l’app Fichiers, touche le .zip pour le décompresser, ouvre le dossier Keep et choisis les fichiers .json. Tu peux aussi choisir des fichiers .txt et .md."
          }
        },
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iz Google Keepa: u Google Takeoutu izvezi Keep. U aplikaciji Datoteke dodirni .zip da ga raspakiraš, otvori mapu Keep i odaberi .json datoteke. Možeš odabrati i .txt i .md datoteke."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Da Google Keep: in Google Takeout, esporta Keep. Nell'app File, tocca il file .zip per estrarlo, apri la cartella Keep e scegli i file .json. Puoi scegliere anche file .txt e .md."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Google Keepから：Google TakeoutでKeepを書き出します。ファイルアプリで.zipをタップして展開し、Keepフォルダを開いて.jsonファイルを選びます。.txtや.mdファイルも選べます。"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Z Google Keep: w Google Takeout wyeksportuj Keep. W aplikacji Pliki stuknij plik .zip, aby go rozpakować, otwórz folder Keep i wybierz pliki .json. Możesz też wybrać pliki .txt i .md."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do Google Keep: no Google Takeout, exporte o Keep. No app Arquivos, toque no .zip para descompactar, abra a pasta Keep e escolha os arquivos .json. Você também pode escolher arquivos .txt e .md."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从 Google Keep 导入：在 Google Takeout 中导出 Keep。在“文件”应用中轻点 .zip 文件解压，打开 Keep 文件夹并选择 .json 文件。也可以选择 .txt 和 .md 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
