    "Only ticked facts leave this iPhone, at most five. A PESEL or an address is left unticked when you add it: tick it, and mark it as one, only if Doddy really needs to give it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Only ticked facts leave this iPad, at most five. A PESEL or an address is left unticked when you add it: tick it, and mark it as one, only if Doddy really needs to give it."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Only ticked facts leave this iPhone, at most five. A PESEL or an address is left unticked when you add it: tick it, and mark it as one, only if Doddy really needs to give it."
